OL,3,GNEWSABan foreign nationals from Welsh
OL,4,Ahouse-shares, says Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther Senedd members argued the policy
OL,7,Fwould impact students, workers able to
OL,8,Flive in the UK legally and even Irish
OL,9,Fcitizens. A Reform MS said it would not
OL,10,Fapply to EU citizens with settled
OL,11,Fstatus.
